{"seq":2,"slug":"snapshot-backup-defrag-restore","title":"快照备份、碎片整理与灾难恢复流程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/etcd-raft-consensus-production-internals/cluster-maintenance/snapshot-backup-defrag-restore","wordCount":2301,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"快照备份-碎片整理与灾难恢复流程\">快照备份、碎片整理与灾难恢复流程</h1><p>凌晨两点，跨境交易链路告警：三节点 etcd 集群里两台因同一块 SSD 的固件 bug 同时掉盘，只剩一台还活着。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(3-1)/2 = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>，两台永久失效已经<strong>不可逆地丢失了 quorum</strong>，集群再也无法自行选出 leader，任何 <code>etcdctl put</code> 都会超时。真正决定这次故障是「两小时恢复」还是「两天恢复」的，是你<strong>上一次快照是什么时候、校验过没有、恢复流程演练过没有</strong>。本文讲三件事：怎么备份、怎么把被压缩掏空的 backend 文件的空间还给文件系统、以及 quorum 真丢了之后怎么从快照重建集群。持久化分层与 raft 存储压缩的关系见同 hub 的 <a href=\"../etcd-raft-log-replication/append-entries-pipeline-snapshot\">AppendEntries 批量流水线与快照追赶机制</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-snapshot-wal-与-backend-三元组\">核心概念：snapshot、WAL 与 backend 三元组</h2><p>etcd 每个成员的 data-dir 里有三个持久化产物，理解它们的角色是备份恢复的前提：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>产物</th>\n<th>路径</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>恢复用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>WAL</td>\n<td><code>member/wal/*.wal</code></td>\n<td>每条 raft 条目的完整记录，追加写、不可变</td>\n<td>崩溃恢复：重放未进快照的条目</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Snapshot</td>\n<td><code>member/snap/*.snap</code></td>\n<td>某个 index 处的状态机全量镜像</td>\n<td>加速启动；跨成员追赶</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backend</td>\n<td><code>member/snap/db</code></td>\n<td>bbolt 文件，MVCC 真实数据 + 空洞</td>\n<td><strong>备份与恢复的真正对象</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[客户端写入 Put] --&gt; B[raft 追加条目到 WAL]&#10;    B --&gt; C[多数派复制成功 → appliedIndex 前进]&#10;    C --&gt; D[应用到 MVCC: 新建 revision&lt;br/&gt;旧版本成为可达但不活跃的版本]&#10;    D --&gt; E{触发 auto-compaction?}&#10;    E --&gt;|否| F[backend 持续增长&lt;br/&gt;in_use 与 total 同步上升]&#10;    E --&gt;|是| G[compact 删除旧 revision&lt;br/&gt;bbolt 页标记为 free,文件不缩小]&#10;    G --&gt; H{触发 defrag?}&#10;    H --&gt;|否| I[total 不变,in_use 下降&lt;br/&gt;碎片率上升 → NOSPACE 风险]&#10;    H --&gt;|是| J[在线重建 backend 副本后原子替换&lt;br/&gt;total 回落到 in_use 附近]\">flowchart TD\n    A[客户端写入 Put] --&gt; B[raft 追加条目到 WAL]\n    B --&gt; C[多数派复制成功 → appliedIndex 前进]\n    C --&gt; D[应用到 MVCC: 新建 revision&lt;br/&gt;旧版本成为可达但不活跃的版本]\n    D --&gt; E{触发 auto-compaction?}\n    E --&gt;|否| F[backend 持续增长&lt;br/&gt;in_use 与 total 同步上升]\n    E --&gt;|是| G[compact 删除旧 revision&lt;br/&gt;bbolt 页标记为 free,文件不缩小]\n    G --&gt; H{触发 defrag?}\n    H --&gt;|否| I[total 不变,in_use 下降&lt;br/&gt;碎片率上升 → NOSPACE 风险]\n    H --&gt;|是| J[在线重建 backend 副本后原子替换&lt;br/&gt;total 回落到 in_use 附近]</pre><p>碎片率是这个模型里最该被监控的派生量。设 <code>etcd_mvcc_db_total_size_in_use_in_bytes</code> 为压缩后真实占用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>in-use</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{\\text{in-use}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">in-use</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，<code>etcd_mvcc_db_total_size_in_bytes</code> 为文件总大小 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{\\text{total}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（v3.4 前叫 <code>etcd_debugging_mvcc_db_total_size_in_bytes</code>），则：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>in-use</mtext></msub><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F = 1 - \\frac{S_{\\text{in-use}}}{S_{\\text{total}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">in-use</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span> 长期高于 0.5 基本说明该成员需要一次 defrag。注意分子分母同时逼近配额时<strong>必须压缩</strong>——只压不整理只降 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>in-use</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{\\text{in-use}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">in-use</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{\\text{total}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 不动，NOSPACE 照样会来。</p>\n<h2 id=\"快照备份-频率-校验与保留策略\">快照备份：频率、校验与保留策略</h2><p>etcd 官方维护文档只给出 <code>etcdctl snapshot save backup.db</code> 与 <code>etcdutl --write-out=table snapshot status backup.db</code> 两条命令，建议「周期性快照」，但<strong>不给具体频率</strong>（<a href=\"https://etcd.io/docs/v3.6/op-guide/maintenance/\">etcd v3.6 op-guide/maintenance</a>）。生产频率由恢复点目标（RPO）反推：能接受最多丢 5 分钟控制面写入就 5 分钟一次；跨境库存预占、订单状态机这类强一致数据通常按 5–15 分钟排。另一约束来自成本——快照与写入竞争同一块磁盘的 IOPS，硬件经验门槛是 SSD 上 fsync 的 p99 ≤ 1 ms（HDD ≤ 10 ms），参考规格 8 vCPU / 32 GB RAM / 50 GB SSD（<a href=\"https://etcd.io/docs/v3.6/op-guide/hardware/\">etcd hardware guide</a>）。</p>\n<p><code>etcdctl snapshot save</code> 产出的文件带<strong>完整性哈希</strong>，恢复时自动校验；若图快直接 <code>cp member/snap/db</code>，该文件<strong>没有哈希</strong>，只能配 <code>--skip-hash-check</code> 恢复，且官方明确警告这样做「可能丢失尚未写入快照、还留在 WAL 里的数据」。所以 <code>cp</code> 只适合磁盘级灾备的辅助副本，不能替代 <code>snapshot save</code>。</p>\n<p>快照必须定期<strong>实际恢复一次</strong>才算数。<code>snapshot status</code> 报出哈希、revision、键总数和总大小——接进巡检，任何一份 revision 比上一份小的快照都说明选错了端点（可能打到落后的 follower，或压到了别的集群）。本地轮转由 <code>--max-snapshots</code> 与 <code>--max-wals</code> 控制，默认都是 <code>5</code>，<code>0</code> 表示不限量（<a href=\"https://etcd.io/docs/v3.6/op-guide/configuration/\">etcd v3.6 configuration</a>）；异地/对象存储的保留周期要单独制定，并且必须<strong>保留一份与旧版本 etcd 兼容的快照</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"压缩与碎片整理-把空间还给文件系统\">压缩与碎片整理：把空间还给文件系统</h2><p>etcd 的 MVCC 让每次写都产生新 revision，旧 revision 在未被压缩前一直占着 backend。<code>--auto-compaction-retention</code> 默认是 <code>&quot;0&quot;</code>，即<strong>默认禁用自动压缩</strong>——这是很多集群突然 NOSPACE 的头号原因。自动压缩有两种模式（同样出自 op-guide/maintenance）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>periodic</code>（默认模式）：<code>--auto-compaction-retention=1h</code> 表示保留 1 小时历史。<strong>保留期超过 1 小时时，第一次压缩发生在保留期结束后，之后每小时一次</strong>；保留期 ≤ 1 小时时按保留间隔压缩。</li>\n<li><code>revision</code>：<code>--auto-compaction-mode=revision --auto-compaction-retention=1000</code> 表示保留 1000 个 revision，etcd 每 5 分钟检查一次，压缩到 <code>最新 revision - 1000</code>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>官方取值建议很具体：<strong>频繁更新的 key 用 <code>1h</code> 或 <code>30m</code>，低频更新用 <code>24h</code>/<code>48h</code>/<code>72h</code>，通用推荐 <code>10h</code></strong>。跨境系统的 watch 消费者（Istio、控制器、库存同步器）依赖「从某个 revision 开始 watch」，保留期太短会迫使它们重新 list 全量，太长则 backend 膨胀。</p>\n<p>压缩只把 bbolt 里的页标记为 free，<strong>不缩小文件</strong>。<code>etcdctl compact 3</code> 之后再读 revision 2 会得到 <code>rpc error: code = 11 desc = etcdserver: mvcc: required revision has been compacted</code>。要真正回收必须 defrag：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"etcdctl defrag --cluster                       # 逐成员整理全部&#10;etcdutl defrag --data-dir /var/lib/etcd        # 成员已停止时离线整理\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">etcdctl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> defrag</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --cluster</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                       # 逐成员整理全部</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">etcdutl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> defrag</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --data-dir</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /var/lib/etcd</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # 成员已停止时离线整理</span></span></code></pre></div><p>碎片整理是<strong>逐成员、不复制、且在线执行时会阻塞该成员的读写</strong>，所以必须串行做、避开业务高峰，并确保做的时候集群仍有 quorum——在只剩两台的集群上同时 defrag 两台，就是自造 quorum 丢失。</p>\n<p>另一个易踩的坑：<code>--snapshot-count</code> 决定内存中保留多少条已应用条目后触发快照并截断 raft 日志，配置页当前列出默认 <code>10000</code>。文档明确指出该值设到 10 万以上会因 Go GC 压力<strong>降低写吞吐</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"nospace-配额治理与故障处置\">NOSPACE：配额治理与故障处置</h2><p><code>--quota-backend-bytes</code> 在配置页的默认值是 <code>&quot;0&quot;</code>，含义是「使用 etcd 内置的低空间配额」（Kubernetes 文档把该内置默认描述为约 2 GiB）。一旦 backend 超过配额，写入侧会收到 <code>rpc error: code = 8 desc = etcdserver: mvcc: database space exceeded</code>，<code>etcdctl alarm list</code> 显示 <code>alarm:NOSPACE</code>。此时集群进入<strong>维护模式：接受读和 delete，不接受普通写入</strong>。</p>\n<p>需要特别注意一个隐蔽语义：<code>Put</code> / <code>Txn</code> / <code>LeaseGrant</code> 可能在<strong>内部实际成功</strong>的同时返回 <code>ErrGRPCNoSpace</code>——Apply 层是在事务之后才抬升 NOSPACE 告警的。客户端收到 NOSPACE 时不能简单假定「这次写一定没生效」，重试前应先读一次确认，否则会制造重复写入。</p>\n<p>官方给出的恢复顺序是四步，不能颠倒：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"etcdctl compact $(etcdctl endpoint status --write-out=json | jq -r &#39;.[0].Status.header.revision&#39;)&#10;etcdctl defrag &amp;&amp; etcdctl alarm disarm\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">etcdctl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> compact</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">etcdctl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> endpoint</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --write-out=json</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> jq</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -r</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '.[0].Status.header.revision'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">etcdctl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> defrag</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x26;&#x26; </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">etcdctl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> alarm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> disarm</span></span></code></pre></div><p>先压到<strong>当前 revision</strong>（比日常自动压缩激进，会删掉全部历史），再 defrag 把空间还给文件系统，才能 disarm；顺序颠倒的话 alarm 会因空间仍超额而立刻重新触发。最后用一次 <code>etcdctl put</code> 验证写入恢复。</p>\n<p>容量规划用近 24 小时的 backend 增长率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>S</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\dot{S}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9202em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9202em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0556em;\"><span class=\"mord\">˙</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 外推剩余可用天数：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>fill</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>S</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{fill}} = (Q - S_{\\text{total}})/\\dot{S}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fill</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1702em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9202em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0556em;\"><span class=\"mord\">˙</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>fill</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{fill}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fill</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 低于 7 天就该介入。经验做法是把 <code>--quota-backend-bytes</code> 显式设到磁盘可用空间的 50–60%，别依赖内置默认。</p>\n<h2 id=\"灾难恢复-从快照重建丢失-quorum-的集群\">灾难恢复：从快照重建丢失 quorum 的集群</h2><p>N 个成员的集群只能容忍 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(N-1)/2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span></span></span></span></span> 个<strong>永久</strong>失效；超过这个数就不可逆地丢失 quorum，必须从快照重建。恢复的铁律是：<strong>所有替换成员必须用同一份快照恢复</strong>，因为 restore 会生成新的 member ID 与 cluster ID，成员间靠新身份重新握手，恢复出来的是<strong>一个全新的逻辑集群</strong>（<a href=\"https://etcd.io/docs/v3.6/op-guide/recovery/\">etcd v3.6 op-guide/recovery</a>）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"etcdctl --endpoints $ENDPOINT snapshot save snapshot.db   # 1 从存活成员取快照&#10;etcdutl snapshot status snapshot.db -w table              # 2 校验哈希与 revision&#10;# 3 每个节点恢复同一份快照，只有 --name / --data-dir / peer URL 不同&#10;etcdutl snapshot restore snapshot.db \\&#10;  --name m1 --data-dir m1_data_dir.etcd \\&#10;  --initial-cluster m1=http://host1:2380,m2=http://host2:2380,m3=http://host3:2380 \\&#10;  --initial-cluster-token etcd-cluster-1 \\&#10;  --initial-advertise-peer-urls http://host1:2380\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">etcdctl</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --endpoints</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $ENDPOINT </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">snapshot</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> save</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> snapshot.db</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">   # 1 从存活成员取快照</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">etcdutl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> snapshot</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> snapshot.db</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -w</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> table</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">              # 2 校验哈希与 revision</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 3 每个节点恢复同一份快照，只有 --name / --data-dir / peer URL 不同</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">etcdutl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> snapshot</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> restore</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> snapshot.db</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --name</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> m1</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --data-dir</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> m1_data_dir.etcd</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --initial-cluster</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> m1=http://host1:2380,m2=http://host2:2380,m3=http://host3:2380</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --initial-cluster-token</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> etcd-cluster-1</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --initial-advertise-peer-urls</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> http://host1:2380</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>--initial-cluster-token</code> 是防「僵尸成员」的开关：它防止恢复出的新成员去连接<strong>可能还活着的旧集群成员</strong>。如果旧成员还在跑，两拨节点互相发现会造成脑裂式日志覆盖，比丢失 quorum 更糟。</p>\n<p>对于 watch 消费者或 Kubernetes，必须另外加两个 flag：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"etcdutl snapshot restore snapshot.db \\&#10;  --bump-revision 1000000000 --mark-compacted --data-dir output-dir\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">etcdutl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> snapshot</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> restore</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> snapshot.db</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --bump-revision</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000000000</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --mark-compacted</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --data-dir</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> output-dir</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>--bump-revision</code> 把快照的 revision 加上一个 64 位整数，官方说明 <strong><code>1000000000</code> 大约能覆盖「一周前的快照 + 每秒低于 1500 次写入」<strong>的组合。它把 revision 推到远超客户端缓存的值，让持有旧 revision 的 watch 立刻失效；<code>--mark-compacted</code> 则确保</strong>所有 watch 被终止</strong>，让 informer 缓存整体失效并触发全量重 list。少这两个 flag，控制器会以为自己从没断过，继续从已丢弃的 revision 开始 watch，然后收到 compacted 错误或静默落后。<code>--force-new-cluster</code> 用本成员数据覆盖集群成员表，看似能救场，但<strong>官方明确强烈不推荐</strong>——旧集群成员还活着时它会直接 panic。</p>\n<p>恢复演练的价值非常直观：从未演练的团队在真实 quorum 丢失中通常要花数小时才发现「快照文件其实一直是空的」或「token 配错导致新旧集群互连」。每季度在影子集群跑一遍，记录从「拿起快照」到「客户端可写」的墙钟时间，作为 DR SLA 指标。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>备份对象是 backend 文件，不是 <code>.snap</code></strong>。<code>snapshot save</code> 导出的文件带哈希、可自动校验；<code>cp member/snap/db</code> 没有哈希，只能 <code>--skip-hash-check</code>，且可能丢 WAL 中未落盘的数据。</li>\n<li><strong>压缩不释放磁盘，defrag 才释放</strong>。<code>--auto-compaction-retention</code> 默认 <code>&quot;0&quot;</code>（禁用），务必显式开启：频繁写 <code>1h</code>/<code>30m</code>，低频写 <code>24h</code>–<code>72h</code>，通用 <code>10h</code>；revision 模式配合 <code>--auto-compaction-mode=revision</code>。defrag 逐成员串行，在线时阻塞该成员读写。</li>\n<li><strong>配额要显式设</strong>。<code>--quota-backend-bytes</code> 默认 <code>&quot;0&quot;</code>（内置低空间配额，约 2 GiB）。NOSPACE 恢复顺序固定为 compact 到当前 revision → defrag → <code>alarm disarm</code> → 验证写入；且 NOSPACE 可能在写入<strong>实际成功</strong>后返回。</li>\n<li><strong>丢失 quorum 后重建规则</strong>：同一份快照恢复所有成员 + 新的 <code>--initial-cluster-token</code>；面向 watch/K8s 必须加 <code>--bump-revision 1000000000 --mark-compacted</code>；<code>--force-new-cluster</code> 强烈不推荐。</li>\n<li><strong>没有演练的备份等于没有备份</strong>。定期用 <code>snapshot status</code> 校验 revision 单调性，并把端到端恢复时间纳入 DR SLA。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"快照备份、碎片整理与灾难恢复流程","id":"快照备份-碎片整理与灾难恢复流程"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：snapshot、WAL 与 backend 三元组","id":"核心概念-snapshot-wal-与-backend-三元组"},{"level":2,"text":"快照备份：频率、校验与保留策略","id":"快照备份-频率-校验与保留策略"},{"level":2,"text":"压缩与碎片整理：把空间还给文件系统","id":"压缩与碎片整理-把空间还给文件系统"},{"level":2,"text":"NOSPACE：配额治理与故障处置","id":"nospace-配额治理与故障处置"},{"level":2,"text":"灾难恢复：从快照重建丢失 quorum 的集群","id":"灾难恢复-从快照重建丢失-quorum-的集群"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"集群成员与 Quorum 模型：learner、投票权与成员变更","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/etcd-raft-consensus-production-internals/cluster-maintenance/cluster-membership-quorum-model"},"next":{"title":"磁盘配额、DB 膨胀与节点替换故障处置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/etcd-raft-consensus-production-internals/cluster-maintenance/disk-quota-node-replacement-incident"}}